      },
      "lines": [
        "妳昨天才說那家很難吃。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day3.lunch-hungry",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
      "time": "11:44",
      "visibleFrom": "day.03",
      "unlock": [],
      "unlockAfter": {
        "archiveBatchId": "batch.day03.archive",
        "archivedCount": 2
      },
      "lines": [
        "昨天的我沒有今天這麼餓。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day3.lunch-ask-player",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
      "time": "11:45",
      "visibleFrom": "day.03",
      "unlock": [],
      "unlockAfter": {
        "archiveBatchId": "batch.day03.archive",
        "archivedCount": 2
      },
      "lines": [
        "新來的，你中午吃什麼？"
      ],
      "replyPrompt": {
        "id": "prompt.day3.lunch-plan",
        "availableThrough": "day.03",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "join",
            "text": "都可以，我跟你們一起。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.join-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "11:46",
                "lines": [
                  "成交。要是警衛又攔人，你負責看起來像主管。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.join-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "11:47",
                "lines": [
                  "他才第三天。不要害人。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ask-floor",
            "text": "七樓為什麼不收外送？",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.floor-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "11:46",
                "lines": [
                  "說是盤點。奇怪的是每次都挑午餐時間。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.floor-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "11:47",
                "lines": [
                  "你不要把普通偷懶講得像都市傳說。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "brought-own",
            "text": "我自己帶了。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day3.reply.own-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "11:46",
                "lines": [
                  "好羨慕。明天記得提醒今天的我。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
